NOTE: this license covers the userspace VA-API driver, Vulkan compute
shaders, and tools in this repository. The DisplayPort/HDMI audio-clock
DKMS kernel module under audio-fix/ is licensed separately, under
GPL-2.0-only (not GPL-3.0) — see audio-fix/LICENSE. That module's own
source (MODULE_LICENSE("GPL v2") in bc250_audio_fix.c) predates this
project's current maintainership and was inherited as-is; its license
was not and could not be unilaterally changed here, since doing so
would misrepresent a license choice this project does not hold the
copyright to alter. GPL-2.0 and GPL-3.0 are not compatible for a single
combined/linked binary, but no such combination exists here — the
kernel module and the userspace driver are separate, unlinked binaries,
so there is no conflict in having each licensed under a different GPL
version.
